(575615, 59628, 9809, '<td valign="top">I''m not a hard-liner "rule of thirds" guy, but I think it would definitely help this image. The bird is way too centered -- but the slight off-center that it is is to the right or the direction of flight. I find it more appealing to have the direction of flight appear to be entering the frame rather than leaving.</td>', 'I''m not a hard-liner "rule of thirds" guy, but I think it would definitely help this image. The bird is way too centered -- but the slight off-center that it is is to the right or the direction of flight. I find it more appealing to have the direction of flight appear to be entering the frame rather than leaving.', '2004-02-11 02:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
