(575692, 58625, 16957, '<td valign="top">This is a well executed shot. I feel though that most of these sadness/parting shots in this challenge must be contrived (I hope so!). After a while I felt this does actually deprive the shot of the authenticity that I feel is part of photography. So I mark all such shots down 1 point equally - can''t be fairer than that.</td>', 'This is a well executed shot. I feel though that most of these sadness/parting shots in this challenge must be contrived (I hope so!). After a while I felt this does actually deprive the shot of the authenticity that I feel is part of photography. So I mark all such shots down 1 point equally - can''t be fairer than that.', '2004-02-11 04:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
