(575885, 59692, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good idea. But it seems very poor in photographic resources. A B&amp;W look or some kind of multi light sources can add to the message expressed. Your contrasts are good. The flash was well used too. But ever try to think that any P&amp;S camera can get it. The flash angle is very commom. Alternative light is a point that split photographers from the crowd.</td>', 'Good idea. But it seems very poor in photographic resources. A B&W look or some kind of multi light sources can add to the message expressed. Your contrasts are good. The flash was well used too. But ever try to think that any P&S camera can get it. The flash angle is very commom. Alternative light is a point that split photographers from the crowd.', '2004-02-11 07:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
