(575958, 58642, 13759, '<td valign="top">Very overexposed. You must have lots of this comment until now. But I really understand that you tryed to isolate hands in a pure white background. Ok if you  taken down the curves in PS you can get a more pleasant picture. Other issue is the yellow light in the edges and over the fingers of right hand. It suggests a direct sunlight or other warm light source. You need to gain full control of you light to take these kind of picture. Using light of same type is recomended.  I know this is hard to take, but it´s our fun.</td>', 'Very overexposed. You must have lots of this comment until now. But I really understand that you tryed to isolate hands in a pure white background. Ok if you  taken down the curves in PS you can get a more pleasant picture. Other issue is the yellow light in the edges and over the fingers of right hand. It suggests a direct sunlight or other warm light source. You need to gain full control of you light to take these kind of picture. Using light of same type is recomended.  I know this is hard to take, but it´s our fun.', '2004-02-11 08:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
