(576832, 58991, 15920, '<td valign="top">This was one of the ideas I thought of and chose not to enter.  In retorspect, I think that was a mistake.  This is a happy image with good colors.  The focus is a little off, and the curvature effect of the tall trees doesn''t help this, but, overall, a nice effort.</td>', 'This was one of the ideas I thought of and chose not to enter.  In retorspect, I think that was a mistake.  This is a happy image with good colors.  The focus is a little off, and the curvature effect of the tall trees doesn''t help this, but, overall, a nice effort.', '2004-02-11 18:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
