(576936, 59239, 15305, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, lots of action. Nice balance and color.</td>', 'Very nice shot, lots of action. Nice balance and color.', '2004-02-11 18:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(576938, 58923, 13487, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the challenge.  IMO this is one of the best this week... only thing that bothers me is the size.... I''d like to see it bigger.  Just a suggestion for future challenges.</td>', 'Excellent take on the challenge.  IMO this is one of the best this week... only thing that bothers me is the size.... I''d like to see it bigger.  Just a suggestion for future challenges.', '2004-02-11 18:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(576940, 59466, 15305, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, captures the feeling of letting go very well. Nice composition and POV. You could try Neat Image to reduce the noise and grain.</td>', 'Very nice shot, captures the feeling of letting go very well. Nice composition and POV. You could try Neat Image to reduce the noise and grain.', '2004-02-11 18:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(576945, 59068, 15305, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Great choice of B&amp;W. Very well balanced and good composition. Interesting light effect creating great mood.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Great choice of B&W. Very well balanced and good composition. Interesting light effect creating great mood.', '2004-02-11 19:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(576946, 59555, 13487, '<td valign="top">Great DOF... I love these shots.</td>', 'Great DOF... I love these shots.', '2004-02-11 19:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(576952, 59124, 10818, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic photo.  I love the softness yet clearity, nice cropping, and I feel it meets the challenge perfectly.  10</td>', 'What a fantastic photo.  I love the softness yet clearity, nice cropping, and I feel it meets the challenge perfectly.  10', '2004-02-11 19:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(576957, 59563, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Nice lighting and DOF.  It conveys the message well.</td>', 'Great shot! Nice lighting and DOF.  It conveys the message well.', '2004-02-11 19:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(576959, 59471, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, nice choice of B&amp;W.</td>', 'Interesting shot, nice choice of B&W.', '2004-02-11 19:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(576960, 58733, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is so close to spectacular!  If that bird had just a little space to dive into, it would be a masterpiece.  Meanwhile, you are to be complimented in getting such a clear, stop action shot.</td>', 'This is so close to spectacular!  If that bird had just a little space to dive into, it would be a masterpiece.  Meanwhile, you are to be complimented in getting such a clear, stop action shot.', '2004-02-11 19:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(576965, 58796, 10818, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling of dejection, with the shrugged shoulders and hung head.  Great background coloring.  Nice one.  8</td>', 'Nice feeling of dejection, with the shrugged shoulders and hung head.  Great background coloring.  Nice one.  8', '2004-02-11 19:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(576968, 59658, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, simple, but still meets the challenge very well.</td>', 'I like this photo, simple, but still meets the challenge very well.', '2004-02-11 19:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(576969, 59484, 15330, '<td valign="top">This is a stretch for meeting the topic. But, as a photo I like it even though the sun is a little dominant of the scene.</td>', 'This is a stretch for meeting the topic. But, as a photo I like it even though the sun is a little dominant of the scene.', '2004-02-11 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(576970, 59663, 10818, '<td valign="top">To bad it such a small picture, because it is a great capture, and fits the theme well.</td>', 'To bad it such a small picture, because it is a great capture, and fits the theme well.', '2004-02-11 19:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(576973, 58913, 17096, '<td valign="top">I would love to know this girl more. Why is she crying?</td>', 'I would love to know this girl more. Why is she crying?', '2004-02-11 19:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(576974, 59083, 17096, '<td valign="top">Muy bien.</td>', 'Muy bien.', '2004-02-11 19:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(576975, 59062, 15330, '<td valign="top">Great capture, must''ve used a very high shutter speed, can''t see any blur, even from the wheels. I think that leaving more room at the bottom, and less room at the top will give the shot a felling of the rifer falling down.</td>', 'Great capture, must''ve used a very high shutter speed, can''t see any blur, even from the wheels. I think that leaving more room at the bottom, and less room at the top will give the shot a felling of the rifer falling down.', '2004-02-11 19:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(576976, 59374, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I like the lighting, but not having the lamp partially in the frame. I think that moving the lamp just out of the frame (keeping the crop on the face) would have made a simpler and more effective image. 7</td>', 'Great idea! I like the lighting, but not having the lamp partially in the frame. I think that moving the lamp just out of the frame (keeping the crop on the face) would have made a simpler and more effective image. 7', '2004-02-11 19:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(576977, 59431, 17096, '<td valign="top">Color of the water is beautiful.</td>', 'Color of the water is beautiful.', '2004-02-11 19:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(576980, 59210, 15330, '<td valign="top">The photo doesn''t meet the challenge, the title does. I do like this as a photo, even though it doesn''t meet the challenge very well. The shadows might be a little too dark, but they do give the photo an interesting mood.</td>', 'The photo doesn''t meet the challenge, the title does. I do like this as a photo, even though it doesn''t meet the challenge very well. The shadows might be a little too dark, but they do give the photo an interesting mood.', '2004-02-11 19:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(576982, 59627, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like this, very original. Better exposure, and lighting would make this photo much better. Even though nothing is blown out there are lots of places that are in very deep shadow.</td>', 'I like this, very original. Better exposure, and lighting would make this photo much better. Even though nothing is blown out there are lots of places that are in very deep shadow.', '2004-02-11 19:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(576983, 59644, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully seen, beautifully photographed, and of course, fits the challenge on several levels.  Good luck. 10</td>', 'This is beautifully seen, beautifully photographed, and of course, fits the challenge on several levels.  Good luck. 10', '2004-02-11 19:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(576984, 58935, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great image.  I hope you only "let go" metaphorically.  9</td>', 'Great image.  I hope you only "let go" metaphorically.  9', '2004-02-11 19:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(576985, 59448, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is a terrific image.  You have projected the energy of this moment well. 9</td>', 'Oh, this is a terrific image.  You have projected the energy of this moment well. 9', '2004-02-11 19:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(576986, 59068, 14476, '<td valign="top">What a splendid, evocative moment.  You have captured it well.  Congratulations.  10</td>', 'What a splendid, evocative moment.  You have captured it well.  Congratulations.  10', '2004-02-11 19:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(576987, 59701, 6405, '<td valign="top">Hand covers the most important parts of the photo,lighting is great,some distractive object behind her nose,9 from me!</td>', 'Hand covers the most important parts of the photo,lighting is great,some distractive object behind her nose,9 from me!', '2004-02-11 19:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(576988, 59643, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed and rendered.  I wish you well with this image.  9</td>', 'Beautifully composed and rendered.  I wish you well with this image.  9', '2004-02-11 19:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(576991, 59185, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good technical photography and a good capture of the letting go of today''s icons. 9</td>', 'Good technical photography and a good capture of the letting go of today''s icons. 9', '2004-02-11 19:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(576992, 59697, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo, although I''m having a tough time connecting it to "Letting Go".  I suppose you could say it''s letting go of the day''s concerns and enjoying the game?  Anyway,  this shot is very inviting.  I like the angle of the chairs, the lighting, and the nice sharp focus on the chess board.</td>', 'I really like the photo, although I''m having a tough time connecting it to "Letting Go".  I suppose you could say it''s letting go of the day''s concerns and enjoying the game?  Anyway,  this shot is very inviting.  I like the angle of the chairs, the lighting, and the nice sharp focus on the chess board.', '2004-02-11 19:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(576993, 59484, 14476, '<td valign="top">I dunno what some people have against sunsets.  I could look at this one for a long, long time.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I dunno what some people have against sunsets.  I could look at this one for a long, long time.  Nicely done.', '2004-02-11 19:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(576995, 59033, 14476, '<td valign="top">Happy, smiling dog looks as if he ''let''s go'' every chance he gets.  Lovely image.</td>', 'Happy, smiling dog looks as if he ''let''s go'' every chance he gets.  Lovely image.', '2004-02-11 19:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(576997, 59658, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful, well composed and thought out image.  I enjoy it immensely.  Thank you.</td>', 'This is such a beautiful, well composed and thought out image.  I enjoy it immensely.  Thank you.', '2004-02-11 19:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(576998, 58913, 17224, '<td valign="top">Short&amp;Sweetness !</td>', 'Short&Sweetness !', '2004-02-11 19:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(576999, 59407, 14986, '<td valign="top">The subject seems too dark to me in this photo.  Looks like fun!</td>', 'The subject seems too dark to me in this photo.  Looks like fun!', '2004-02-11 19:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(577000, 59497, 14986, '<td valign="top">I had this same shot in my head as a possibility.  I think all mothers and fathers can appreciate the "letting go" factor in this shot!    The photo itself is very well done with good exposure and composition.  I like how she''s walking away from you with that quick look back and wave.</td>', 'I had this same shot in my head as a possibility.  I think all mothers and fathers can appreciate the "letting go" factor in this shot!    The photo itself is very well done with good exposure and composition.  I like how she''s walking away from you with that quick look back and wave.', '2004-02-11 19:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(577002, 59485, 14986, '<td valign="top">I want to be there!  :)</td>', 'I want to be there!  :)', '2004-02-11 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(577003, 59659, 16957, '<td valign="top">An arresting image though unsure of relevance</td>', 'An arresting image though unsure of relevance', '2004-02-11 19:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(577004, 58991, 14986, '<td valign="top">I did this same shot as one of my two possibilities for this challenge.  I wish I would have had your blue skies!  Nice photo, but I wish the house wasn''t in the picture.  I think it would have been better with a simple background.  Focus and exposure are good.</td>', 'I did this same shot as one of my two possibilities for this challenge.  I wish I would have had your blue skies!  Nice photo, but I wish the house wasn''t in the picture.  I think it would have been better with a simple background.  Focus and exposure are good.', '2004-02-11 19:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(577005, 59124, 14986, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful portrait!  Colors and exposure are really great.    The connection to the challenge is maybe a little weak, but it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'What a wonderful portrait!  Colors and exposure are really great.    The connection to the challenge is maybe a little weak, but it''s a nice shot.', '2004-02-11 19:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(577007, 59692, 14986, '<td valign="top">Adorable shot.  His expression is perfect.  Good lighting and exposure.  I like this one.</td>', 'Adorable shot.  His expression is perfect.  Good lighting and exposure.  I like this one.', '2004-02-11 19:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
