(577161, 59062, 15242, '<td valign="top">Great catch, obviously you have a very nice camera.  some color enhancing in photoshot would have made this a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Great catch, obviously you have a very nice camera.  some color enhancing in photoshot would have made this a ribbon winner.', '2004-02-11 21:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(577164, 59181, 772, '<td valign="top">This is nice... a good take on a classic theme.  the black and white works nicely here and the slight amount of motion is also excellent :)  Great shot..</td>', 'This is nice... a good take on a classic theme.  the black and white works nicely here and the slight amount of motion is also excellent :)  Great shot..', '2004-02-11 21:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(577165, 59465, 15242, '<td valign="top">Nice catch, but too bright on the top center.</td>', 'Nice catch, but too bright on the top center.', '2004-02-11 21:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(577166, 59666, 10819, '<td valign="top">nice. i think maybe it would have looked nice with a closer up pov.</td>', 'nice. i think maybe it would have looked nice with a closer up pov.', '2004-02-11 21:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(577167, 59677, 15242, '<td valign="top">Too fabricated.</td>', 'Too fabricated.', '2004-02-11 21:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(577168, 58671, 772, '<td valign="top">I love it... I like everything about this photo.  I think it would be even stronger as a straight b/w.  The toning here possibly implies some amount of ''warmth'' rather than a harsh cold to go along with the environment.  If you would like to play with toning that would support the theme of this photo, u may wanna try some blues... excellent work :)</td>', 'I love it... I like everything about this photo.  I think it would be even stronger as a straight b/w.  The toning here possibly implies some amount of ''warmth'' rather than a harsh cold to go along with the environment.  If you would like to play with toning that would support the theme of this photo, u may wanna try some blues... excellent work :)', '2004-02-11 21:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(577169, 59555, 10819, '<td valign="top">really nice dof pov and composition..crisp clear and black and white wonderfulness.</td>', 'really nice dof pov and composition..crisp clear and black and white wonderfulness.', '2004-02-11 21:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(577170, 59184, 7778, '<td valign="top">A very good title.</td>', 'A very good title.', '2004-02-11 21:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(577171, 59562, 10819, '<td valign="top">i really love the drops of water splashing up. ii dont really like the lighting too much.</td>', 'i really love the drops of water splashing up. ii dont really like the lighting too much.', '2004-02-11 21:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(577172, 59550, 15920, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, but I don''t understand the connection to the challenge.</td>', 'Cool picture, but I don''t understand the connection to the challenge.', '2004-02-11 21:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(577173, 59185, 10819, '<td valign="top">really nice crisp clean shot..no bad lighting on your hand or anything else to complain about ;) i even think your border is okay ;)</td>', 'really nice crisp clean shot..no bad lighting on your hand or anything else to complain about ;) i even think your border is okay ;)', '2004-02-11 21:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(577174, 59550, 15242, '<td valign="top">I see what you were going for and it was a nice attempt.  But I still don''t how it says letting go.</td>', 'I see what you were going for and it was a nice attempt.  But I still don''t how it says letting go.', '2004-02-11 21:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
