(577179, 59375, 15242, '<td valign="top">A lot of noise on the bottom of the shot and i''m not sure how it says letting go.</td>', 'A lot of noise on the bottom of the shot and i''m not sure how it says letting go.', '2004-02-11 21:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
