(577222, 59550, 327, '<td valign="top">Give me a clue ....what am I looking at?? To be fair I really don''t know what this is and can''t vote it till I know.<br/></td>', 'Give me a clue ....what am I looking at?? To be fair I really don''t know what this is and can''t vote it till I know.', '2004-02-11 21:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
