(577225, 59424, 327, '<td valign="top">Disco__.Lionel Riche.....sail on down the line.....lol<br/>Yeah, I''m older then dirt. Terrible music, and worse clothes!! YIKES. lol<br/>Good entry.</td>', 'Disco__.Lionel Riche.....sail on down the line.....lolYeah, I''m older then dirt. Terrible music, and worse clothes!! YIKES. lolGood entry.', '2004-02-11 21:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
