(577227, 59692, 327, '<td valign="top">He looks so serious! Good actor and he doesn''t want to give up that blankie. lol<br/>Neat idea for the challenge but I think you should of been lower with the camera and used a bit of cover on your light.</td>', 'He looks so serious! Good actor and he doesn''t want to give up that blankie. lolNeat idea for the challenge but I think you should of been lower with the camera and used a bit of cover on your light.', '2004-02-11 21:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
