(577246, 59101, 16818, '<td valign="top">Great use of the theme. I can feel the pain of letting go in this way!</td>', 'Great use of the theme. I can feel the pain of letting go in this way!', '2004-02-11 22:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(577250, 59333, 6073, '<td valign="top">Great idea/concept.  Wish I had thought of it.</td>', 'Great idea/concept.  Wish I had thought of it.', '2004-02-11 22:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(577268, 59068, 17041, '<td valign="top">My vote for the blue ribbon.  Great metaphor here.  The high contrast, lighting, and use of b&amp;w all contribute to a theme of letting go and crossing over to the other side.  Well done!</td>', 'My vote for the blue ribbon.  Great metaphor here.  The high contrast, lighting, and use of b&w all contribute to a theme of letting go and crossing over to the other side.  Well done!', '2004-02-11 22:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(577274, 59698, 16695, '<td valign="top">Woohoo!  Someone capturing the theme...and original about it. :)  My only suggestion for the photo would be working with the angle a bit more.  It''s not quite tilted and and it''s not quite dead on; it''s distracting trying to work that out in the mind.<br/>Still, very nice. :) 9.</td>', 'Woohoo!  Someone capturing the theme...and original about it. :)  My only suggestion for the photo would be working with the angle a bit more.  It''s not quite tilted and and it''s not quite dead on; it''s distracting trying to work that out in the mind.Still, very nice. :) 9.', '2004-02-11 22:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(577277, 59209, 16695, '<td valign="top">NIce smooth lighting &amp; colors, fun shadow play, and good use of different ages (hands),  but ... nothing too eye capturing of original for the theme.</td>', 'NIce smooth lighting & colors, fun shadow play, and good use of different ages (hands),  but ... nothing too eye capturing of original for the theme.', '2004-02-11 22:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(577286, 59082, 16695, '<td valign="top">Wait. What?  You''re not letting the door handle drop to the floor?<br/>*grin* Sorry, I''m jaded.<br/>Very nice work here, I love symmetry for one.  The "cold" tone heightens the emotional impact and the fact that a lot is hidden from view really just leaves it to our imagination. :) Thanks for making something that kept my eye.</td>', 'Wait. What?  You''re not letting the door handle drop to the floor?*grin* Sorry, I''m jaded.Very nice work here, I love symmetry for one.  The "cold" tone heightens the emotional impact and the fact that a lot is hidden from view really just leaves it to our imagination. :) Thanks for making something that kept my eye.', '2004-02-11 22:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(577299, 58913, 14606, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for a nice B&amp;W.  very nice!</td>', 'I''m a sucker for a nice B&W.  very nice!', '2004-02-11 23:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(577302, 58671, 6349, '<td valign="top">My favorite for the challenge so far.  It''s going in my favorites when it''s over.  10.  Excellent work.  I wish I could think of such creative things.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-18 00:27:50.</i></td>', 'My favorite for the challenge so far.  It''s going in my favorites when it''s over.  10.  Excellent work.  I wish I could think of such creative things.', '2004-02-11 23:16:00.000000', '2004-02-18 00:27:50.000000', 1),
(577305, 59672, 14606, '<td valign="top">looks like fun</td>', 'looks like fun', '2004-02-11 23:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(577308, 59101, 6349, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge.  Great composition and exposure.  I particularly like that her face is hidden by the umbrella and the contrast of her blacks running perfectly with the direction of the shadows.  Hope this gets top 3.  10</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge.  Great composition and exposure.  I particularly like that her face is hidden by the umbrella and the contrast of her blacks running perfectly with the direction of the shadows.  Hope this gets top 3.  10', '2004-02-11 23:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(577309, 58862, 6349, '<td valign="top">Top shot.  Love the color and texture contrasts.</td>', 'Top shot.  Love the color and texture contrasts.', '2004-02-11 23:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(577310, 59699, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Great idea.  I particularly like the shadows the soap bubbles made on the fork in the water.  Wonderful composition.</td>', 'Great photo.  Great idea.  I particularly like the shadows the soap bubbles made on the fork in the water.  Wonderful composition.', '2004-02-11 23:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(577311, 59663, 14606, '<td valign="top">If only i were 16 again</td>', 'If only i were 16 again', '2004-02-11 23:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(577313, 59046, 6349, '<td valign="top">Delightful capture.  You really managed to catch the feeling of the event.  Hope you didn''t take the plunge WITH your camera.  One of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Delightful capture.  You really managed to catch the feeling of the event.  Hope you didn''t take the plunge WITH your camera.  One of the best in the challenge.', '2004-02-11 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(577314, 59069, 6349, '<td valign="top">true.</td>', 'true.', '2004-02-11 23:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(577316, 59645, 6349, '<td valign="top">Simply wonderful.  I love the colors, softness, and composition.  Top shot.</td>', 'Simply wonderful.  I love the colors, softness, and composition.  Top shot.', '2004-02-11 23:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(577317, 59062, 14606, '<td valign="top">"and your ass will follow"...  Funkadellic</td>', '"and your ass will follow"...  Funkadellic', '2004-02-11 23:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(577318, 59446, 17014, '<td valign="top">The hand could have been placed better to have the effect of dropping.  But the idea is a good one.  =)</td>', 'The hand could have been placed better to have the effect of dropping.  But the idea is a good one.  =)', '2004-02-11 23:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(577320, 58913, 6349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful neatimaging, especially on the tear.  Great lighting.  The nose stud really ads a tasteful element.  Top shot.</td>', 'Beautiful neatimaging, especially on the tear.  Great lighting.  The nose stud really ads a tasteful element.  Top shot.', '2004-02-11 23:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(577323, 59635, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great.  One of my favorites.  I like your post processing very much too, the border however, detracts from the awesome photo in my opinion.  Still a 10</td>', 'Great.  One of my favorites.  I like your post processing very much too, the border however, detracts from the awesome photo in my opinion.  Still a 10', '2004-02-11 23:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(577324, 59314, 6349, '<td valign="top">Shit.  That happened to me recently!  Nice to finally see a more realistic and creative approach on the letter theme.</td>', 'Shit.  That happened to me recently!  Nice to finally see a more realistic and creative approach on the letter theme.', '2004-02-11 23:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
