(577537, 59053, 16695, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a very cool sense of motion and "impending doom", but it feels like the photo is lacking in vibrance.  The composition is pretty straight on and nothing (other than the hammer) pops out at the viewer. Maybe white posterboard for the mat instead of cloth?  *shrug* There''s a lot to play with.</td>', 'You''ve got a very cool sense of motion and "impending doom", but it feels like the photo is lacking in vibrance.  The composition is pretty straight on and nothing (other than the hammer) pops out at the viewer. Maybe white posterboard for the mat instead of cloth?  *shrug* There''s a lot to play with.', '2004-02-12 02:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(577562, 58917, 11785, '<td valign="top">Cliche</td>', 'Cliche', '2004-02-12 03:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(577568, 59666, 10084, '<td valign="top">Lighting is excellent. Really help to make this a moody composition. The blackground really helps to make the envelope and the ring pop out of the shot. Great hightlights on the ring.</td>', 'Lighting is excellent. Really help to make this a moody composition. The blackground really helps to make the envelope and the ring pop out of the shot. Great hightlights on the ring.', '2004-02-12 03:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
