(577603, 59526, 14499, '<td valign="top">Hehe! very clever, the more I look at it the more I see the Frayed Octopus strap, but it looks good at first. I had the Idea of letting someone go over a cliff but it was to hard to pull off.... done well.</td>', 'Hehe! very clever, the more I look at it the more I see the Frayed Octopus strap, but it looks good at first. I had the Idea of letting someone go over a cliff but it was to hard to pull off.... done well.', '2004-02-12 06:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
