(577608, 59466, 14499, '<td valign="top">This would have got a far higher mark from me (7 or 8) had the quality of the photo been better. Its a great concept and would have looked great... whats with the dark edges also?</td>', 'This would have got a far higher mark from me (7 or 8) had the quality of the photo been better. Its a great concept and would have looked great... whats with the dark edges also?', '2004-02-12 06:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
