(577617, 59045, 14499, '<td valign="top">Good Idea, but the shadow on the white paper is a dead give away and detracts from the image it could have been.</td>', 'Good Idea, but the shadow on the white paper is a dead give away and detracts from the image it could have been.', '2004-02-12 06:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(577618, 59660, 15832, '<td valign="top">very creative. How??</td>', 'very creative. How??', '2004-02-12 06:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(577619, 59446, 14499, '<td valign="top">Clever Idea, but that one roll of film apears to be above the dropping point which made me think "not right" and then pick at it. middle of the road 5. but thats prety high it this particular comp :O</td>', 'Clever Idea, but that one roll of film apears to be above the dropping point which made me think "not right" and then pick at it. middle of the road 5. but thats prety high it this particular comp :O', '2004-02-12 06:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(577622, 59542, 14499, '<td valign="top">Loosing grip would have been a great title! Physical and Mentle ?</td>', 'Loosing grip would have been a great title! Physical and Mentle ?', '2004-02-12 07:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(577626, 59679, 14499, '<td valign="top">Hehe! you love getting in your shots don''t you?! I think the title would have been better as "Resposability? Still a kid at hart" or parts there of. Its hard to work in a title on this one. I also think repaeting the Challenge subject in the title will loose you points also, the Title should reflect that. See if you can guess mine?</td>', 'Hehe! you love getting in your shots don''t you?! I think the title would have been better as "Resposability? Still a kid at hart" or parts there of. Its hard to work in a title on this one. I also think repaeting the Challenge subject in the title will loose you points also, the Title should reflect that. See if you can guess mine?', '2004-02-12 07:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(577628, 59474, 14499, '<td valign="top">This is starting to become a comon theme! My fav so far though :)</td>', 'This is starting to become a comon theme! My fav so far though :)', '2004-02-12 07:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(577630, 58795, 14499, '<td valign="top">This is IMO pushing the Theme, It is technicaly hanging on, letting go would be handing over the remote :)  ANyway we will see what other people think, I may be wrong... it was a dificult one, I did a lot of hard thinking.</td>', 'This is IMO pushing the Theme, It is technicaly hanging on, letting go would be handing over the remote :)  ANyway we will see what other people think, I may be wrong... it was a dificult one, I did a lot of hard thinking.', '2004-02-12 07:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(577632, 59379, 15920, '<td valign="top">I like backpacking as well.  This looks like a great spot, and I kind of wish I had been taggin along.  For technique, I would have tried to get better focus, and more depth of field to get the entire image sharper.</td>', 'I like backpacking as well.  This looks like a great spot, and I kind of wish I had been taggin along.  For technique, I would have tried to get better focus, and more depth of field to get the entire image sharper.', '2004-02-12 07:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(577633, 58991, 10799, '<td valign="top">To emphasis the challenge it might have been better without the house in the background.  The trees help to show the height of the ballons well enough.  Also if the hand were a bit less centered it might be stronger.</td>', 'To emphasis the challenge it might have been better without the house in the background.  The trees help to show the height of the ballons well enough.  Also if the hand were a bit less centered it might be stronger.', '2004-02-12 07:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(577641, 59635, 14499, '<td valign="top">Wow this image looks so sureal, I am hoping you didn''t PS it as it was Basic Editing rules. Iteresting take on Letting Go too.... pushing it a bit but you will still score high from me.<br/> <br/>**** CONGRATS ON YOUR PLACING*********<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-18 01:44:54.</i></td>', 'Wow this image looks so sureal, I am hoping you didn''t PS it as it was Basic Editing rules. Iteresting take on Letting Go too.... pushing it a bit but you will still score high from me. **** CONGRATS ON YOUR PLACING*********', '2004-02-12 07:43:37.000000', '2004-02-18 01:44:54.000000', 1),
