(577673, 59679, 15305, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, interesting shot.</td>', 'Nice idea, interesting shot.', '2004-02-12 08:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(577676, 59360, 15305, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I wanted to do the same, but couldn''t find the chance. Nice use of B&amp;W and the mood is superb.</td>', 'Nice shot, I wanted to do the same, but couldn''t find the chance. Nice use of B&W and the mood is superb.', '2004-02-12 08:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(577678, 58991, 15305, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, interesting shot. Nice POV.</td>', 'Nice idea, interesting shot. Nice POV.', '2004-02-12 08:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(577681, 58911, 92, '<td valign="top">The DOF really puts the focus on the main subject. The rich bright colors just make you like this photo. The one thing I think you did very well is your DOF and slight movement in the background and street area gives this that movement/action feeling. It brings the photo to life and the viewer feels the action. I hope this does well in the challenge...it''s a great photo !</td>', 'The DOF really puts the focus on the main subject. The rich bright colors just make you like this photo. The one thing I think you did very well is your DOF and slight movement in the background and street area gives this that movement/action feeling. It brings the photo to life and the viewer feels the action. I hope this does well in the challenge...it''s a great photo !', '2004-02-12 08:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(577683, 59635, 17245, '<td valign="top">exelent ! I love this picture. Sharp, and it looks like you have eyecontact with the animal.</td>', 'exelent ! I love this picture. Sharp, and it looks like you have eyecontact with the animal.', '2004-02-12 08:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(577687, 59433, 4153, '<td valign="top">good concept, good photo, the base does reduce contrast a bit, background is a bit distracting too and I''m not a big fan of big frames, the black frame wit a thin white line would be easier for me too look at ;o)</td>', 'good concept, good photo, the base does reduce contrast a bit, background is a bit distracting too and I''m not a big fan of big frames, the black frame wit a thin white line would be easier for me too look at ;o)', '2004-02-12 08:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(577708, 59304, 92, '<td valign="top">My only 10...well my only vote even over a 7. This didn''t need a title to explain it. The composition is wonderful. The viewer feels the mood of the photo without words or explanation.</td>', 'My only 10...well my only vote even over a 7. This didn''t need a title to explain it. The composition is wonderful. The viewer feels the mood of the photo without words or explanation.', '2004-02-12 08:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(577710, 58824, 2344, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, the posing, the seamless white background is great but I do not like her expression. She looks like she ate something sour.</td>', 'I like the idea, the posing, the seamless white background is great but I do not like her expression. She looks like she ate something sour.', '2004-02-12 08:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(577716, 59624, 15305, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect.  I''ve tried to do something like that with no success. I''d appreciate some pointers after the Challenge is over. Nice use of color and light.</td>', 'Very interesting effect.  I''ve tried to do something like that with no success. I''d appreciate some pointers after the Challenge is over. Nice use of color and light.', '2004-02-12 08:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(577717, 59032, 15305, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, great lighting and POV.</td>', 'Very nice shot, great lighting and POV.', '2004-02-12 08:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(577718, 59654, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice use of B&amp;W. The composition is very interesting.</td>', 'Great shot, nice use of B&W. The composition is very interesting.', '2004-02-12 09:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(577719, 58731, 15305, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. Nice composition.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. Nice composition.', '2004-02-12 09:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(577721, 58969, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting. I hope it didn''t break! :-)</td>', 'Great composition and lighting. I hope it didn''t break! :-)', '2004-02-12 09:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(577722, 59046, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, that must be very cold!!! Brrrrr.</td>', 'Interesting shot, that must be very cold!!! Brrrrr.', '2004-02-12 09:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(577723, 59659, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great POV and superb lighting.</td>', 'Great POV and superb lighting.', '2004-02-12 09:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(577725, 59287, 15305, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! great composition and lighting. The duotone background is very interesting. I can almost hear the balloon....</td>', 'Very nice shot! great composition and lighting. The duotone background is very interesting. I can almost hear the balloon....', '2004-02-12 09:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(577726, 59184, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, nice composition. The shot would benefit from Neat Image processing to eliminate unwanted noise.</td>', 'Interesting idea, nice composition. The shot would benefit from Neat Image processing to eliminate unwanted noise.', '2004-02-12 09:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(577728, 58674, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and well done shot. Nice use of B&amp;W and the expression is superb.</td>', 'Interesting idea and well done shot. Nice use of B&W and the expression is superb.', '2004-02-12 09:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(577746, 59360, 6999, '<td valign="top">Now I have a dilemma: this is such a ceareful shot - certainly in its post work. But I don''t find it terribly emotive, and it seems (partly from the title) to be so <i>deliberately</i> pulling at the heart strings. It is, at least, a touch more restrained than some of the ''despairing'' shots. Guess i''ll have to come back to it.</td>', 'Now I have a dilemma: this is such a ceareful shot - certainly in its post work. But I don''t find it terribly emotive, and it seems (partly from the title) to be so deliberately pulling at the heart strings. It is, at least, a touch more restrained than some of the ''despairing'' shots. Guess i''ll have to come back to it.', '2004-02-12 09:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(577753, 59658, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great shot. Interesting spotlight effect in background. Good lighting.</td>', 'Great idea, great shot. Interesting spotlight effect in background. Good lighting.', '2004-02-12 09:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(577755, 59433, 15305, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great POV. Nice choice of B&amp;W.  We sure are letting go with this!!! :-)</td>', 'Nice shot, great POV. Nice choice of B&W.  We sure are letting go with this!!! :-)', '2004-02-12 09:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(577756, 58911, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photojournalism shot - the ''technical errors'', the blurring and the exposure help enormously. The bead of sweat about to fall from his nose is a masterful touch to capture. The subject is perhaps the diametric opposite of the challenge title, but that would be churlish grounds on which to mark this down. I hope not too many people have.</td>', 'Wonderful photojournalism shot - the ''technical errors'', the blurring and the exposure help enormously. The bead of sweat about to fall from his nose is a masterful touch to capture. The subject is perhaps the diametric opposite of the challenge title, but that would be churlish grounds on which to mark this down. I hope not too many people have.', '2004-02-12 09:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(577758, 59313, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great shot, interesting use of negative space in composition. Her expression says it all.</td>', 'Great shot, interesting use of negative space in composition. Her expression says it all.', '2004-02-12 09:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(577761, 59053, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nice shot, interesting contrast in colors. Great sense of motion in the hammer.  A little more light on the camera to make it stand out from the background would have been interesting.</td>', 'Great idea, nice shot, interesting contrast in colors. Great sense of motion in the hammer.  A little more light on the camera to make it stand out from the background would have been interesting.', '2004-02-12 09:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(577763, 59442, 15305, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, interesting use of B&amp;W. Interesting POV.</td>', 'Nice shot, interesting use of B&W. Interesting POV.', '2004-02-12 09:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(577764, 59542, 15305, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, great use of B&amp;W and great balance and composition. Very strong.</td>', 'Excellent shot, great use of B&W and great balance and composition. Very strong.', '2004-02-12 09:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(577765, 59636, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, nice shot. It would have been interesting to use a different apperture to enhance the subject and blur the background, which is distracting because of all the elements in it.</td>', 'Interesting idea, nice shot. It would have been interesting to use a different apperture to enhance the subject and blur the background, which is distracting because of all the elements in it.', '2004-02-12 09:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(577769, 58936, 15305, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great DOF.</td>', 'Nice shot, great DOF.', '2004-02-12 09:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(577770, 59645, 16230, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I like the use of light and shadow, and the look on her face is great. The spots on the wall are a minor distraction, and I wish the butterfly was real. It''s one of the top 3 photos in this challenge in my book. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice photo. I like the use of light and shadow, and the look on her face is great. The spots on the wall are a minor distraction, and I wish the butterfly was real. It''s one of the top 3 photos in this challenge in my book. Good job.', '2004-02-12 09:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(577773, 59485, 15305, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Nice balance and composition.</td>', 'Nice shot. Nice balance and composition.', '2004-02-12 09:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(577781, 59698, 9295, '<td valign="top">I love your interpretation of the challenge. What better demonstration of letting go than the father of the bride giving away his little girl.  Although I like this photo just fine, wouldn''t it have been neat to have been able to capture that moment inside the church where he actually releases her to her new life?  Anyway, nice job.</td>', 'I love your interpretation of the challenge. What better demonstration of letting go than the father of the bride giving away his little girl.  Although I like this photo just fine, wouldn''t it have been neat to have been able to capture that moment inside the church where he actually releases her to her new life?  Anyway, nice job.', '2004-02-12 10:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(577785, 58951, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image, and it''s a shame that it doesn''t fit the challenge better.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image, and it''s a shame that it doesn''t fit the challenge better.', '2004-02-12 10:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(577788, 59020, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the challenge and the only 10 I gave.  Not only do I like the interpretation of the challenge theme, but there are little details all over the place that involve my mind and imagination.  The mournful posture of the man and upside down flower bouquet barely being contained in his loose grip...resignation to his loss.  The depth of the footprints...neither cold nor snow could keep him away.  The irregular rows of tombstones and the array of trees in the background emphasizing the clearing in which this man''s beloved''s grave sits...somewhat apart from the others.  The lack of color.  The contrast between black and white.  The sun fighting to be seen through the grey sky and leafless branches...hope?  Yeah. I like this one a lot.</td>', 'This is my favorite of the challenge and the only 10 I gave.  Not only do I like the interpretation of the challenge theme, but there are little details all over the place that involve my mind and imagination.  The mournful posture of the man and upside down flower bouquet barely being contained in his loose grip...resignation to his loss.  The depth of the footprints...neither cold nor snow could keep him away.  The irregular rows of tombstones and the array of trees in the background emphasizing the clearing in which this man''s beloved''s grave sits...somewhat apart from the others.  The lack of color.  The contrast between black and white.  The sun fighting to be seen through the grey sky and leafless branches...hope?  Yeah. I like this one a lot.', '2004-02-12 10:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(577790, 59062, 16230, '<td valign="top">This would have been great if the rider had let go of the handle bars. Nice capture!</td>', 'This would have been great if the rider had let go of the handle bars. Nice capture!', '2004-02-12 10:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(577796, 59314, 16230, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I love the title.</td>', 'Great photo. I love the title.', '2004-02-12 10:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(577798, 59460, 9295, '<td valign="top">I rarely give out 1''s, but I did on this photo and so I would like to comment to tell you why.  I think I understand why you might have submitted such a blurry, unfocused shot, trying to show motion, but in this case, it simply doesn''t work.  It''s bothersome to the eye since there is absolutely nothing in focus.  The overexposure is unappealing and washes out the details of the child''s face and, particularly, smile.  The pole on the left suggests there may be something of interest over there, but since we don''t know what, it''s unimportant to the shot and perhaps even a distraction (as is the blue thing in the background).  In my opinion, this is just a snapshot gone horribly wrong.  I propose trying again only this time, work to capture that expression instead of hiding it behind a big bright blur.</td>', 'I rarely give out 1''s, but I did on this photo and so I would like to comment to tell you why.  I think I understand why you might have submitted such a blurry, unfocused shot, trying to show motion, but in this case, it simply doesn''t work.  It''s bothersome to the eye since there is absolutely nothing in focus.  The overexposure is unappealing and washes out the details of the child''s face and, particularly, smile.  The pole on the left suggests there may be something of interest over there, but since we don''t know what, it''s unimportant to the shot and perhaps even a distraction (as is the blue thing in the background).  In my opinion, this is just a snapshot gone horribly wrong.  I propose trying again only this time, work to capture that expression instead of hiding it behind a big bright blur.', '2004-02-12 10:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(577803, 59695, 9295, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but not a very appealing photo.  This is a common dispute between husband and wife/ parent and child so most of us can relate it to the challenge theme, but the problem is the execution of your shot.  It looks like a snapshot, with unappealing colors and lighting and needless clutter (the toys around the trash pail, the bag lining in the pail, the cat decorations in the background (although those are cute, they are distracting to the shot) and the splotches of dirt or whatever it is on the baseboard.  The overall composition just doesn''t work very well.</td>', 'Nice concept, but not a very appealing photo.  This is a common dispute between husband and wife/ parent and child so most of us can relate it to the challenge theme, but the problem is the execution of your shot.  It looks like a snapshot, with unappealing colors and lighting and needless clutter (the toys around the trash pail, the bag lining in the pail, the cat decorations in the background (although those are cute, they are distracting to the shot) and the splotches of dirt or whatever it is on the baseboard.  The overall composition just doesn''t work very well.', '2004-02-12 10:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(577806, 59573, 9295, '<td valign="top">Your biggest problem here is perhaps your choice of backdrops. The toy gets washed out since they are of such similar colors and tones.  The lighting does little to help the situation.</td>', 'Your biggest problem here is perhaps your choice of backdrops. The toy gets washed out since they are of such similar colors and tones.  The lighting does little to help the situation.', '2004-02-12 10:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(577807, 58779, 9295, '<td valign="top">I don''t care at all for the double exposure technique you used for this shot.  I appreciate your desire to show motion in the drop, but it''s just not well done.</td>', 'I don''t care at all for the double exposure technique you used for this shot.  I appreciate your desire to show motion in the drop, but it''s just not well done.', '2004-02-12 10:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(577808, 59107, 16230, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, and I am not sure why. Maybe it''s the ambiguity; did someone else just leave, or is she deciding which way to go, or... Alternatively, maybe I am just dense and missing the point completely. &lt;g&gt; Anyway, I like it.</td>', 'I like this photo, and I am not sure why. Maybe it''s the ambiguity; did someone else just leave, or is she deciding which way to go, or... Alternatively, maybe I am just dense and missing the point completely. <g> Anyway, I like it.', '2004-02-12 10:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
