(578600, 59563, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, the lighting could have been better, but I think it still works like this. I think that you should have placed your arm so that it wasn''t in the shot. You should have also strained your hand so that it looked like you were trying to hold yourself from falling of the edge. But, overall I do like the photo, and think your take on the theme is interesting, and from what I''ve seen of other entries, original.</td>', 'I like the photo, the lighting could have been better, but I think it still works like this. I think that you should have placed your arm so that it wasn''t in the shot. You should have also strained your hand so that it looked like you were trying to hold yourself from falling of the edge. But, overall I do like the photo, and think your take on the theme is interesting, and from what I''ve seen of other entries, original.', '2004-02-12 22:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
