(578663, 59654, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture... I love this type of ''street photography''.  I have been looking at a lot of it lately.  I don''t know if this guy is homeless or not but the dirt under his fingernails really seems to stand out for me... along with the unshaven face.  The ''kramer'' hair and the ''i don''t give a dam'' look on the face really creates some punch for me also.  There are all sorts of subtleties in this image that are nice... I wonder how many people will notice the out of focus ''no smoking'' sign in the background :)  If I should forget to add this photo to my favorites, please remind me :)  Excellent capture...</td>', 'This is a great capture... I love this type of ''street photography''.  I have been looking at a lot of it lately.  I don''t know if this guy is homeless or not but the dirt under his fingernails really seems to stand out for me... along with the unshaven face.  The ''kramer'' hair and the ''i don''t give a dam'' look on the face really creates some punch for me also.  There are all sorts of subtleties in this image that are nice... I wonder how many people will notice the out of focus ''no smoking'' sign in the background :)  If I should forget to add this photo to my favorites, please remind me :)  Excellent capture...', '2004-02-12 23:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
