(579390, 59644, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF and the detail in the wings, old "shell" and wood. I think the image feels a little tightly cropped at the top.</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF and the detail in the wings, old "shell" and wood. I think the image feels a little tightly cropped at the top.', '2004-02-13 17:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
