(579392, 59483, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice image, lighting supports the emotions depicted. I know it''s odd but I find the hairy chest somewhat distracting/ offputting (I know I know it''s a personal preference) but I wonder if choosing a less revealing top would allow the other weirdos like me to focus more on the face and letter? Does this get weirdest comment award or what?</td>', 'Nice image, lighting supports the emotions depicted. I know it''s odd but I find the hairy chest somewhat distracting/ offputting (I know I know it''s a personal preference) but I wonder if choosing a less revealing top would allow the other weirdos like me to focus more on the face and letter? Does this get weirdest comment award or what?', '2004-02-13 17:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(579394, 59062, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fantastic - this totally depicts freeing the mind to me! Composition is also superb!</td>', 'Fantastic - this totally depicts freeing the mind to me! Composition is also superb!', '2004-02-13 17:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(579395, 59112, 11324, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!  You could have used this one for this challenge or for the "Depth of Field" - great shot. 9</td>', 'Brilliant!  You could have used this one for this challenge or for the "Depth of Field" - great shot. 9', '2004-02-13 17:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(579397, 59060, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good close up. Feels a somewhat too literal interpretation for me - my favourite images this week are those that evoke the emotion itself.</td>', 'Nice composition, good close up. Feels a somewhat too literal interpretation for me - my favourite images this week are those that evoke the emotion itself.', '2004-02-13 17:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(579399, 59539, 3087, '<td valign="top">Totally conveys the sentiment! A powerful image which suits the black and white choice.</td>', 'Totally conveys the sentiment! A powerful image which suits the black and white choice.', '2004-02-13 17:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(579402, 58920, 3087, '<td valign="top">I can picture the scene... holding on to memories, letting go of the pain.</td>', 'I can picture the scene... holding on to memories, letting go of the pain.', '2004-02-13 17:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(579408, 59313, 3087, '<td valign="top">The composition is excellent - the sweep of her hair gives a beautiful curve as well as really cutting her off from the black space. And the rich black in her eyes really plays well against that background. Wonderfully evocative.</td>', 'The composition is excellent - the sweep of her hair gives a beautiful curve as well as really cutting her off from the black space. And the rich black in her eyes really plays well against that background. Wonderfully evocative.', '2004-02-13 17:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(579414, 59535, 3087, '<td valign="top">Although the subject IS soft I would prefer more focus in the image.<br/>Nice composition, nice interpretation.</td>', 'Although the subject IS soft I would prefer more focus in the image.Nice composition, nice interpretation.', '2004-02-13 17:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(579416, 58923, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a very very emotional shot. I would prefer it to be larger in size - more striking still I think. I like the position of the head in the corner and the casual positioning of the hands. I''d appreciate if you would confirm that this is a staged shot via email if you''re willing.</td>', 'Wow, this is a very very emotional shot. I would prefer it to be larger in size - more striking still I think. I like the position of the head in the corner and the casual positioning of the hands. I''d appreciate if you would confirm that this is a staged shot via email if you''re willing.', '2004-02-13 17:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(579418, 59146, 3087, '<td valign="top">Diagonal works well, as does simplicity of content.</td>', 'Diagonal works well, as does simplicity of content.', '2004-02-13 17:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(579420, 58951, 3087, '<td valign="top">This shot makes me feel peaceful. I love that triangle formed by the silhouette of the bank. Diagonals and straight lines miz very well. It''s beautiful.</td>', 'This shot makes me feel peaceful. I love that triangle formed by the silhouette of the bank. Diagonals and straight lines miz very well. It''s beautiful.', '2004-02-13 17:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(579422, 59068, 3087, '<td valign="top">I find the lighting a little harsh and contrast a little high but I do like the content very much, and part of that is the shadows thrown by that strong light. The texture of the cobbles is wonderful.</td>', 'I find the lighting a little harsh and contrast a little high but I do like the content very much, and part of that is the shadows thrown by that strong light. The texture of the cobbles is wonderful.', '2004-02-13 17:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(579423, 59668, 3087, '<td valign="top">A moving image, well composed. I''m not keen on the colour toning of the black and white. I think straight black and white may have had more impact for me.</td>', 'A moving image, well composed. I''m not keen on the colour toning of the black and white. I think straight black and white may have had more impact for me.', '2004-02-13 17:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(579426, 59101, 3087, '<td valign="top">Perfectly composed, perfect viewpoint - watching her grief but not intruding. I wonder if a little fill in light on the headstone would improve this, just to bring out the detail a touch more? I really like this very much.</td>', 'Perfectly composed, perfect viewpoint - watching her grief but not intruding. I wonder if a little fill in light on the headstone would improve this, just to bring out the detail a touch more? I really like this very much.', '2004-02-13 17:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(579429, 59112, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic - doesn''t evoke the sentiment strongly - it''s rather a literal interpretation for my liking - but the image itself is just excellent. I love that approach of focusing on the frisbee and having the young guy out of focus. This would have been great in shallow DOF too! Great use of composition, colour and DOF.</td>', 'This is fantastic - doesn''t evoke the sentiment strongly - it''s rather a literal interpretation for my liking - but the image itself is just excellent. I love that approach of focusing on the frisbee and having the young guy out of focus. This would have been great in shallow DOF too! Great use of composition, colour and DOF.', '2004-02-13 17:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(579430, 58854, 3087, '<td valign="top">Amazing textures and I love the beige and brown palette. The star shape is beautiful.</td>', 'Amazing textures and I love the beige and brown palette. The star shape is beautiful.', '2004-02-13 17:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(579431, 59020, 3087, '<td valign="top">Content is excellent, I think the composition is not as strong as it might be, for me.</td>', 'Content is excellent, I think the composition is not as strong as it might be, for me.', '2004-02-13 17:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(579433, 59406, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is the essence of black and white - light and form! Love it!</td>', 'This is the essence of black and white - light and form! Love it!', '2004-02-13 17:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(579434, 59663, 3087, '<td valign="top">Main subject is much too small for me - I want to be CLOSE in so I can see him letting go rather than taking in so much of his drab surroundings.</td>', 'Main subject is much too small for me - I want to be CLOSE in so I can see him letting go rather than taking in so much of his drab surroundings.', '2004-02-13 17:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(579436, 59701, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is exactly how I let go and unwind... I have a wonderful hot bath, with Lush bath goodies, I have a drink to hand, maybe some chocolates or strawberries, and a pile of magazines or a good book. This speaks volumes to me and is also a nicely composed image with good choice of black and white and shallow DOF.</td>', 'This is exactly how I let go and unwind... I have a wonderful hot bath, with Lush bath goodies, I have a drink to hand, maybe some chocolates or strawberries, and a pile of magazines or a good book. This speaks volumes to me and is also a nicely composed image with good choice of black and white and shallow DOF.', '2004-02-13 17:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(579437, 59135, 3087, '<td valign="top">Pleeeease don''t be offended (and if you are, PM me and I''ll delete my comment) but the first thing I thought of when I saw his expression was that he was in pain or had, ahem, just released some odious gases. :o( <br/>I did immediately "get" that he''s simply in the grip of a powerful emotion and really feeling his music. I would crop a touch at top and right to close in as you have on left and bottom.</td>', 'Pleeeease don''t be offended (and if you are, PM me and I''ll delete my comment) but the first thing I thought of when I saw his expression was that he was in pain or had, ahem, just released some odious gases. :o( I did immediately "get" that he''s simply in the grip of a powerful emotion and really feeling his music. I would crop a touch at top and right to close in as you have on left and bottom.', '2004-02-13 17:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
