(579922, 59082, 17228, '<td valign="top">I liked the low angle of this shot with lines leading to the focal point of the pic. Great depth of field. Clean and simple. Cropped view forces your mind to fill in the blanks.  Blue hue to overall image adds to the cold feel of tile fllooring. Nice  :)</td>', 'I liked the low angle of this shot with lines leading to the focal point of the pic. Great depth of field. Clean and simple. Cropped view forces your mind to fill in the blanks.  Blue hue to overall image adds to the cold feel of tile fllooring. Nice  :)', '2004-02-14 13:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(579925, 59627, 17228, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the man has just shoved his old car off a cliff, doing a Russian Cossack dance in celebration, or I''m a witness to a hit-and-run manslaughter incicent. My mind is a blur with questions, and the title of this pic didn''t help one bit either!  :)    I''m not sure why, but I like this pic. Call it the ''crazy'' in me.  :)</td>', 'Not sure if the man has just shoved his old car off a cliff, doing a Russian Cossack dance in celebration, or I''m a witness to a hit-and-run manslaughter incicent. My mind is a blur with questions, and the title of this pic didn''t help one bit either!  :)    I''m not sure why, but I like this pic. Call it the ''crazy'' in me.  :)', '2004-02-14 13:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(579928, 58854, 17228, '<td valign="top">I know this is probably just a spent flower that has gone to seed, but it also looks like a old man trying in vain to run from his inevitable death. OK, maybe I''m reading too much into this pic.  ;)  Interesting and painterly looking.</td>', 'I know this is probably just a spent flower that has gone to seed, but it also looks like a old man trying in vain to run from his inevitable death. OK, maybe I''m reading too much into this pic.  ;)  Interesting and painterly looking.', '2004-02-14 13:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
