(580295, 59433, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like that you used black and white here. The lighting could be better, I don''t like how the inside of the lens hood is in such deep shadow. Putting a white, or black background behind the camera would make the photo better, the bcakground less distracting.</td>', 'I like that you used black and white here. The lighting could be better, I don''t like how the inside of the lens hood is in such deep shadow. Putting a white, or black background behind the camera would make the photo better, the bcakground less distracting.', '2004-02-14 23:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(580304, 59687, 326, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2004-02-15 00:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(580312, 59044, 15920, '<td valign="top">The focus on the eye could be stronger, but I like the shutter speed and the effect of freezing the water droplets.</td>', 'The focus on the eye could be stronger, but I like the shutter speed and the effect of freezing the water droplets.', '2004-02-15 01:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
