(580325, 59068, 8953, '<td valign="top">A lot of emotion comes through in this image. I like the use of B&amp;W. The only thing I would wish for here would be a little less contrast...a cloudy or over cast day would have made this perfect..IMHO:) 9</td>', 'A lot of emotion comes through in this image. I like the use of B&W. The only thing I would wish for here would be a little less contrast...a cloudy or over cast day would have made this perfect..IMHO:) 9', '2004-02-15 02:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
