(582498, 59526, 11738, '<td valign="top">That''s sort of funny, until it happens.  I almost lost a good buddy of mine on a climbing fall where the rope almost broke like that.  The outter shroud got ripped and the inner rope puffed like that, but not so bad.  Scared the crap out of both of us.<br/> <br/>Ok composition, but too much light in upper left and not enough at lower right.  White part of rope is overexposed<br/></td>', 'That''s sort of funny, until it happens.  I almost lost a good buddy of mine on a climbing fall where the rope almost broke like that.  The outter shroud got ripped and the inner rope puffed like that, but not so bad.  Scared the crap out of both of us. Ok composition, but too much light in upper left and not enough at lower right.  White part of rope is overexposed', '2004-02-16 20:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(582499, 59053, 7467, '<td valign="top">Did you use a strobe to do this? I have seen other shots like this and curious how you  do it.<br/></td>', 'Did you use a strobe to do this? I have seen other shots like this and curious how you  do it.', '2004-02-16 20:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
