(582920, 59126, 4906, '<td valign="top">Would have worked better if the arrow was further on it''s way. Good capture though.</td>', 'Would have worked better if the arrow was further on it''s way. Good capture though.', '2004-02-17 06:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(582921, 59210, 15995, '<td valign="top">just great composition and fully charged...the expression very nicely captured.</td>', 'just great composition and fully charged...the expression very nicely captured.', '2004-02-17 06:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(582922, 58969, 4906, '<td valign="top">Glass should be shown falling further from hand to give more of a ''letting go'' effect.</td>', 'Glass should be shown falling further from hand to give more of a ''letting go'' effect.', '2004-02-17 06:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(582925, 59660, 4906, '<td valign="top">These shots look better if you start with the car far away and then roll it to your hand. As it is, it looks as the car is travelling backwards.</td>', 'These shots look better if you start with the car far away and then roll it to your hand. As it is, it looks as the car is travelling backwards.', '2004-02-17 06:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(582952, 59460, 179, '<td valign="top">I''m not exactly sure what this shot means to you. Something tells me it means a great deal so I''ll try to convey what I see. For me, the lighting is to bright, and the fact that no part of the picture is in focus is distracting. Maybe a higher shutter speed would''ve fixed that. As for the composition, it''s pretty good, I like the post on the left, although I would have liked to see the right hand and more of the subject. score: 4   Well done nontheless! Good luck!</td>', 'I''m not exactly sure what this shot means to you. Something tells me it means a great deal so I''ll try to convey what I see. For me, the lighting is to bright, and the fact that no part of the picture is in focus is distracting. Maybe a higher shutter speed would''ve fixed that. As for the composition, it''s pretty good, I like the post on the left, although I would have liked to see the right hand and more of the subject. score: 4   Well done nontheless! Good luck!', '2004-02-17 07:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(582958, 59573, 179, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to capture the challenge quite well. Kuddos for that. I like the subject and the composition is nice as well. The lighting is what bothers me here, the colors look faded out, and the brick is the same color as the bunny which doesn''t "pop" as much as it should. Brightness and contrast could have been adjusted here a bit. Score:4  Well done nontheless! Good luck!</td>', 'You''ve managed to capture the challenge quite well. Kuddos for that. I like the subject and the composition is nice as well. The lighting is what bothers me here, the colors look faded out, and the brick is the same color as the bunny which doesn''t "pop" as much as it should. Brightness and contrast could have been adjusted here a bit. Score:4  Well done nontheless! Good luck!', '2004-02-17 07:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(582961, 59668, 16075, '<td valign="top">I really like the color tone on this one.<br/></td>', 'I really like the color tone on this one.', '2004-02-17 07:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(582966, 59333, 16075, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  My brother and I were discussing this and he agreed it is a very nice photo but could not really see how it fit the challenge.  I don''t know if I am right, but I told him I thought it might have something to do with the rusted metal peeling away...that it is slowly letting go to the elements.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  My brother and I were discussing this and he agreed it is a very nice photo but could not really see how it fit the challenge.  I don''t know if I am right, but I told him I thought it might have something to do with the rusted metal peeling away...that it is slowly letting go to the elements.', '2004-02-17 07:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(582969, 59474, 16075, '<td valign="top">Great shot and fitting to the category.  Of the many entries centerd on this theme, I  liked your''s the best.</td>', 'Great shot and fitting to the category.  Of the many entries centerd on this theme, I  liked your''s the best.', '2004-02-17 07:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(582970, 59423, 179, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get this photo. Although I want to get it... leaves letting go of the tree?<br/>I see where the "whimsical" comes into play, those colors are indeed whimsical! For me, they''re a little to bright, the glare on the rock is distracting. A higher shutter speed would''ve maybe helped a bit. If you''ve adjusted the contrast afterwards, then maybe try a little less contrast and a little less brightness in the future. SCORE: 4   Well done nonetheless! Good luck!</td>', 'I''m not sure I get this photo. Although I want to get it... leaves letting go of the tree?I see where the "whimsical" comes into play, those colors are indeed whimsical! For me, they''re a little to bright, the glare on the rock is distracting. A higher shutter speed would''ve maybe helped a bit. If you''ve adjusted the contrast afterwards, then maybe try a little less contrast and a little less brightness in the future. SCORE: 4   Well done nonetheless! Good luck!', '2004-02-17 07:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(582971, 59314, 16075, '<td valign="top">Good sense of humor and very nicely done.</td>', 'Good sense of humor and very nicely done.', '2004-02-17 07:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(582975, 59526, 16075, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo and fitting to theme.</td>', 'Very nice photo and fitting to theme.', '2004-02-17 07:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(582980, 59670, 16075, '<td valign="top">Makes a cute little story.  I like this one very much.</td>', 'Makes a cute little story.  I like this one very much.', '2004-02-17 07:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(582982, 59184, 179, '<td valign="top">We clearly feel the hand letting go of something, kuddos for that. Fore me, the photo is a little grainy which could have been fixed in Neat Image. I would''ve liked to have seen the hand in focus a little more but I know that was a long exposure so, it''s a bit harder to do with a living subject especially that close. The background  takes away from the overall colors which could''ve poped a little more.<br/>SCORE: 4 Well done nonetheless! Good luck!</td>', 'We clearly feel the hand letting go of something, kuddos for that. Fore me, the photo is a little grainy which could have been fixed in Neat Image. I would''ve liked to have seen the hand in focus a little more but I know that was a long exposure so, it''s a bit harder to do with a living subject especially that close. The background  takes away from the overall colors which could''ve poped a little more.SCORE: 4 Well done nonetheless! Good luck!', '2004-02-17 07:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(582986, 58951, 16075, '<td valign="top">If the boat were floating down the river instead of chained up the idea would have gotten across better, but it is a nice photograph.</td>', 'If the boat were floating down the river instead of chained up the idea would have gotten across better, but it is a nice photograph.', '2004-02-17 07:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(582987, 58843, 16075, '<td valign="top">Fitting subject.</td>', 'Fitting subject.', '2004-02-17 07:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(582992, 59692, 179, '<td valign="top">I just love the look on this boy''s face. You''ve managed to capture an emotion and that''s not always easy to do. The background, a black comforter I presume, is a bit distracting for me. The cropping is a little tight, but the focus is well done. I think this would''ve appealed to me a great deal more in B&amp;W. SCORE:5  Well done! Good luck!</td>', 'I just love the look on this boy''s face. You''ve managed to capture an emotion and that''s not always easy to do. The background, a black comforter I presume, is a bit distracting for me. The cropping is a little tight, but the focus is well done. I think this would''ve appealed to me a great deal more in B&W. SCORE:5  Well done! Good luck!', '2004-02-17 07:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(582993, 59560, 16075, '<td valign="top">Nice effort and good interpretation of the theme.</td>', 'Nice effort and good interpretation of the theme.', '2004-02-17 07:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(582996, 59068, 16075, '<td valign="top">Nicely done black &amp; white photo.  Thought provoking...perhaps letting go of the past and moving on in another direction?</td>', 'Nicely done black & white photo.  Thought provoking...perhaps letting go of the past and moving on in another direction?', '2004-02-17 07:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(582997, 59465, 16075, '<td valign="top">Caught the essence of the theme very well.</td>', 'Caught the essence of the theme very well.', '2004-02-17 07:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(582998, 59469, 179, '<td valign="top">This is a really good idea! For me, it was maybe cropped a little tight. But what bothers me most here is the brightness and contrast. Both are too high and instead of helping the photo, it''s distracting. SCORE: 5 Well done and good luck!</td>', 'This is a really good idea! For me, it was maybe cropped a little tight. But what bothers me most here is the brightness and contrast. Both are too high and instead of helping the photo, it''s distracting. SCORE: 5 Well done and good luck!', '2004-02-17 07:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(583000, 59636, 14614, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more of the subject''s details so some lighting on the back would help me connect with them.</td>', 'I would like to see more of the subject''s details so some lighting on the back would help me connect with them.', '2004-02-17 07:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(583004, 59550, 14614, '<td valign="top">As an abstract, this is an engaging shot but since I''m looking at it in the context of the topic, I can''t identify the image (looks like nail clippers?) so I''ve scored it lower than it may deserve.</td>', 'As an abstract, this is an engaging shot but since I''m looking at it in the context of the topic, I can''t identify the image (looks like nail clippers?) so I''ve scored it lower than it may deserve.', '2004-02-17 07:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(583007, 59423, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here.  The composition would be stronger if there were a main focual point.</td>', 'I like the colors here.  The composition would be stronger if there were a main focual point.', '2004-02-17 07:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(583009, 59675, 16075, '<td valign="top">Are you through with the goodies and letting go of an unhealthy way of eating,.or through with dieting and going to enjoy yourself?  Either way, it fits the category.</td>', 'Are you through with the goodies and letting go of an unhealthy way of eating,.or through with dieting and going to enjoy yourself?  Either way, it fits the category.', '2004-02-17 07:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(583012, 59124, 179, '<td valign="top">Upon first seeing this photo I thought it was pretty good but did nothing for me as far as meeting the challenge. I don''t have kids, so the thought of letting go didn''t occur to me right away. I''ve looked at this 3 times and now I get it. I hope others will too as it is a very well done photo. SCORE: 7 Well done and good luck!</td>', 'Upon first seeing this photo I thought it was pretty good but did nothing for me as far as meeting the challenge. I don''t have kids, so the thought of letting go didn''t occur to me right away. I''ve looked at this 3 times and now I get it. I hope others will too as it is a very well done photo. SCORE: 7 Well done and good luck!', '2004-02-17 07:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(583016, 59700, 16075, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo...looks more like molten lava....you better let go.</td>', 'Interesting photo...looks more like molten lava....you better let go.', '2004-02-17 07:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(583017, 58731, 16075, '<td valign="top">Artistic photo but do not see the relevance. If I could figure out how it tied in with the theme I would have rated it higher.</td>', 'Artistic photo but do not see the relevance. If I could figure out how it tied in with the theme I would have rated it higher.', '2004-02-17 07:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(583019, 59542, 179, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to capture an emotion and as a result, I called my mom the minute I saw this photo. Great use of B&amp;W , fits the challenge, and I like the composition. It''s cropped a little tight but that''s just knitpicking. SCORE: 8  Well done and good luck!</td>', 'You''ve managed to capture an emotion and as a result, I called my mom the minute I saw this photo. Great use of B&W , fits the challenge, and I like the composition. It''s cropped a little tight but that''s just knitpicking. SCORE: 8  Well done and good luck!', '2004-02-17 07:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(583020, 59478, 14614, '<td valign="top">To have more impact I''d suggest more even lighting on your subject.  There are too many possible focal points in your shot.  The "booze" collection, the cue stick and balls,the drums and guitars each could be the area to highlight but by selecting them all you''ve not given me anything.</td>', 'To have more impact I''d suggest more even lighting on your subject.  There are too many possible focal points in your shot.  The "booze" collection, the cue stick and balls,the drums and guitars each could be the area to highlight but by selecting them all you''ve not given me anything.', '2004-02-17 07:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(583023, 59435, 14614, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more of the sunset in order to connect it with your title.</td>', 'I''d like to see more of the sunset in order to connect it with your title.', '2004-02-17 07:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(583026, 58731, 14614, '<td valign="top">The picture is a bit small - use all 640 on one dimension so your viewers will have a better size shot to enjoy.  Because of the size, I loose a lot of the detail that I''m sure is in the shot and was part of your thinking in composing it the way you did.</td>', 'The picture is a bit small - use all 640 on one dimension so your viewers will have a better size shot to enjoy.  Because of the size, I loose a lot of the detail that I''m sure is in the shot and was part of your thinking in composing it the way you did.', '2004-02-17 07:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(583028, 59332, 179, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing people aren''t thrilled with this photo as it is water drops. I''m not tired of them yet, so good idea as far as I''m concerned. I would have liked to have seen the droplets in line with the big drop, I know that''s no easy task. Also, the image in the droplets takes away from the simplicity of this shot. Maybe try a neutral background. One droplet has a little glare in it which is a bit distracting. SCORE : 7 Well done and good luck!</td>', 'I''m guessing people aren''t thrilled with this photo as it is water drops. I''m not tired of them yet, so good idea as far as I''m concerned. I would have liked to have seen the droplets in line with the big drop, I know that''s no easy task. Also, the image in the droplets takes away from the simplicity of this shot. Maybe try a neutral background. One droplet has a little glare in it which is a bit distracting. SCORE : 7 Well done and good luck!', '2004-02-17 07:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(583032, 59485, 14614, '<td valign="top">Good idea here (vacation on a cruise ship?) but the details are too remote to connect me to a feeling of letting go.  I''d rather be focused on one person in a lounge chair that trying to take in the whole scene.</td>', 'Good idea here (vacation on a cruise ship?) but the details are too remote to connect me to a feeling of letting go.  I''d rather be focused on one person in a lounge chair that trying to take in the whole scene.', '2004-02-17 07:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(583039, 59071, 16075, '<td valign="top">If I am interpreting this subject correctly (which, with the sign of somebody falling off the cliff, and this looking like a barrier warning you not to get close to the edge) your title would seem to indicate suicide.  I don''t like morbid interpretations, so I am giving you a lower score than I would based on the merits of the photo alone.</td>', 'If I am interpreting this subject correctly (which, with the sign of somebody falling off the cliff, and this looking like a barrier warning you not to get close to the edge) your title would seem to indicate suicide.  I don''t like morbid interpretations, so I am giving you a lower score than I would based on the merits of the photo alone.', '2004-02-17 08:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(583042, 59112, 16075, '<td valign="top">Good shot.</td>', 'Good shot.', '2004-02-17 08:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(583043, 59562, 14614, '<td valign="top">Like your idea of letting us see the result of letting go.  I could be the angle but I don''t get the sense of motion (looking in from the side might give me more of the splash).  The colors contrast nicely with each other but the lighting on the water and the ball could be used to direct my attention to what you saw in the shot.  As it is it''s more of a 50/50 cut across the image.</td>', 'Like your idea of letting us see the result of letting go.  I could be the angle but I don''t get the sense of motion (looking in from the side might give me more of the splash).  The colors contrast nicely with each other but the lighting on the water and the ball could be used to direct my attention to what you saw in the shot.  As it is it''s more of a 50/50 cut across the image.', '2004-02-17 08:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(583045, 59627, 16075, '<td valign="top">I got a chuckle out of this one...clever idea.</td>', 'I got a chuckle out of this one...clever idea.', '2004-02-17 08:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(583047, 59666, 16075, '<td valign="top">Many entries depicting this theme.  Nicely done, however I liked one of the others better.</td>', 'Many entries depicting this theme.  Nicely done, however I liked one of the others better.', '2004-02-17 08:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(583050, 59545, 14614, '<td valign="top">Your subject''s pose lets me fill in the blanks.  To make the shot better in my opinion, I''d like to see less of everything else.  Cropping tighter on her, blurring the railing (as is it''s fighting with her for my attention)  The stuff in the basket is too small to let me know what you put in there but too busy to be a metaphor for stuff she''s throwing away.</td>', 'Your subject''s pose lets me fill in the blanks.  To make the shot better in my opinion, I''d like to see less of everything else.  Cropping tighter on her, blurring the railing (as is it''s fighting with her for my attention)  The stuff in the basket is too small to let me know what you put in there but too busy to be a metaphor for stuff she''s throwing away.', '2004-02-17 08:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(583051, 59045, 16676, '<td valign="top">Was the idea to create an image of the hand leaving the pen? IMO, the pen and hand look as if they are placed on a surface. The peon or the hand should have given a feeling of motion. <br/> <br/>The pen seems to be out of focus.<br/></td>', 'Was the idea to create an image of the hand leaving the pen? IMO, the pen and hand look as if they are placed on a surface. The peon or the hand should have given a feeling of motion.  The pen seems to be out of focus.', '2004-02-17 08:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
