(583739, 58796, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this and think it''s bang on for the challenge. Nice color. I think the impact would of been stronger if would would of been closer to his face,,,,that or if he was turned away from the camera looking out. ?Just my 2cents and ya know what that''s worth. :) Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this and think it''s bang on for the challenge. Nice color. I think the impact would of been stronger if would would of been closer to his face,,,,that or if he was turned away from the camera looking out. ?Just my 2cents and ya know what that''s worth. :) Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-17 18:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(583741, 59448, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this and think it''s good for this challenge. It would of scored higher for me if the focus was better. It''s a little soft. You did a great light control job ...with the flashy dresses. I hope you can shoot them again sometime. Neat shot. Good luck.</td>', 'I like this and think it''s good for this challenge. It would of scored higher for me if the focus was better. It''s a little soft. You did a great light control job ...with the flashy dresses. I hope you can shoot them again sometime. Neat shot. Good luck.', '2004-02-17 18:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(583743, 59239, 327, '<td valign="top">Might of had more impact if you were a bit closer or zoomed in on the rider. Also I think if you had bent down and gotten a bit lower with the snowmobile. It''s a fine shot, good color and sharp. It just  needs a bit more impact. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Might of had more impact if you were a bit closer or zoomed in on the rider. Also I think if you had bent down and gotten a bit lower with the snowmobile. It''s a fine shot, good color and sharp. It just  needs a bit more impact. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-17 19:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(583746, 59304, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this shot...the tones are nice, but I think it falls short with the movement of the beads and the angle it was shot from. Just my 2cents and that''s not worth a lot. :)<br/>I hope you''ll shoot more like this, could be a great series of shots. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this shot...the tones are nice, but I think it falls short with the movement of the beads and the angle it was shot from. Just my 2cents and that''s not worth a lot. :)I hope you''ll shoot more like this, could be a great series of shots. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-17 19:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(583748, 59469, 327, '<td valign="top">Althought the colors are nice and the idea is on target for the challenge, this is just a bit un-interesting. The glass balls appear over sharpened and the light is very harsh. I hope that is helpful, and not hurtful. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Althought the colors are nice and the idea is on target for the challenge, this is just a bit un-interesting. The glass balls appear over sharpened and the light is very harsh. I hope that is helpful, and not hurtful. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-17 19:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(583749, 59545, 327, '<td valign="top">I understand what your shooting/or what she is doing, but this is just not of interest. There is so much going on. The texture of the basket, snow, deck, rails, purple gown, trees, feet......too much happening here to really focus the viewer and draw them into the shot. I hope this is helpful and not hurtful. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I understand what your shooting/or what she is doing, but this is just not of interest. There is so much going on. The texture of the basket, snow, deck, rails, purple gown, trees, feet......too much happening here to really focus the viewer and draw them into the shot. I hope this is helpful and not hurtful. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-17 19:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(583751, 58902, 327, '<td valign="top">I get your idea. I understand the intent, but it''s not a very interesting shot. Sorry, not ment to be personal attack on you or your work. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I get your idea. I understand the intent, but it''s not a very interesting shot. Sorry, not ment to be personal attack on you or your work. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-17 19:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
