(583754, 59460, 327, '<td valign="top">Lots of movement here......yes I see she is on a swing/slide. Not a very interesting or high quailty shot. The light is very harsh. Of course to you personally because you know her I''m sure the feeling is different. :)</td>', 'Lots of movement here......yes I see she is on a swing/slide. Not a very interesting or high quailty shot. The light is very harsh. Of course to you personally because you know her I''m sure the feeling is different. :)', '2004-02-17 19:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
