(583865, 59046, 14476, '<td valign="top">Ahh, the human condition.  And another good reason for wearing clothing.  Well done.  DOF was excellent and I hope you protected your camera from splashes.  It may be that a polarizing lens would have helped that sky, but it continues (on 3rd look)  to be well worth a 7.</td>', 'Ahh, the human condition.  And another good reason for wearing clothing.  Well done.  DOF was excellent and I hope you protected your camera from splashes.  It may be that a polarizing lens would have helped that sky, but it continues (on 3rd look)  to be well worth a 7.', '2004-02-17 20:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
