(583884, 59664, 14476, '<td valign="top">On my first run-through I scored this a 7.  On my last, I will say: This is a powerful image which tells a story.  That''s what photography is all about.  Nicely captured.</td>', 'On my first run-through I scored this a 7.  On my last, I will say: This is a powerful image which tells a story.  That''s what photography is all about.  Nicely captured.', '2004-02-17 20:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(583903, 58923, 10268, '<td valign="top">I would have like to have seen this bigger.</td>', 'I would have like to have seen this bigger.', '2004-02-17 21:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(583909, 59534, 12392, '<td valign="top">This is a very good picture. The shadows are great. The white balance is perfect. Lighting is also good, and the concept is original. I realy like this picture....great job....I think it''s the only ten (10) in the group. Good luck, I hope you win.</td>', 'This is a very good picture. The shadows are great. The white balance is perfect. Lighting is also good, and the concept is original. I realy like this picture....great job....I think it''s the only ten (10) in the group. Good luck, I hope you win.', '2004-02-17 21:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(583939, 59626, 17209, '<td valign="top">Great Lighting</td>', 'Great Lighting', '2004-02-17 22:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(583977, 59679, 327, '<td valign="top">I understand you idea here, but  I don''t think this shot presents it clearly ....we don''t see the swing...but we see a chain, arm and branches in the background. To realize this we''d of needed to see her fully. Hope this is somewhat helpful to you.</td>', 'I understand you idea here, but  I don''t think this shot presents it clearly ....we don''t see the swing...but we see a chain, arm and branches in the background. To realize this we''d of needed to see her fully. Hope this is somewhat helpful to you.', '2004-02-17 22:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(583978, 59465, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like the action, and sense of joy in the photo. Goes with the challenge very well, although in a different way than I was originally thinking. The idea was great, but the photo could use a more interesting composition. The subject is too centered (rule of thirds). There are also some details lost in the black suit, the areas in shadow have no details. But, if you exposed for the suit you would''ve blown out the background, so in that scene there wasn''t much you could do. Overall I like the photo, keep up the good work.</td>', 'I like the action, and sense of joy in the photo. Goes with the challenge very well, although in a different way than I was originally thinking. The idea was great, but the photo could use a more interesting composition. The subject is too centered (rule of thirds). There are also some details lost in the black suit, the areas in shadow have no details. But, if you exposed for the suit you would''ve blown out the background, so in that scene there wasn''t much you could do. Overall I like the photo, keep up the good work.', '2004-02-17 22:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(583980, 59315, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I think this falls short only in the fact that it''s full of noise and not very sharp or crisp. Hope this is helpful in some way. It''s not meant to be hurtful. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice idea. I think this falls short only in the fact that it''s full of noise and not very sharp or crisp. Hope this is helpful in some way. It''s not meant to be hurtful. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-17 22:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(583981, 58767, 327, '<td valign="top">Not crazy for the composition ...what is that off to the right? What I do like is the clean, crisp focus and the beautiful teal/green. This is good focus. Good luck.</td>', 'Not crazy for the composition ...what is that off to the right? What I do like is the clean, crisp focus and the beautiful teal/green. This is good focus. Good luck.', '2004-02-17 22:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(583984, 59020, 15428, '<td valign="top">nice idea, well done</td>', 'nice idea, well done', '2004-02-17 22:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(583985, 59701, 327, '<td valign="top">I am only bothered by the lack of focus and the strong light in the back on the wall. I know....sounds picky but that is how I see this other wise attractive shot. It''s a good entry for the challenge, good luck.</td>', 'I am only bothered by the lack of focus and the strong light in the back on the wall. I know....sounds picky but that is how I see this other wise attractive shot. It''s a good entry for the challenge, good luck.', '2004-02-17 22:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(583986, 59330, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like the effect (used a similar one in my shot). Ithink it would work better with a dark background. This is because you wouldn''t see through the hand as much, and would fit with the picture better, I assume you weren''t trying to get a happy mood out of it.</td>', 'I like the effect (used a similar one in my shot). Ithink it would work better with a dark background. This is because you wouldn''t see through the hand as much, and would fit with the picture better, I assume you weren''t trying to get a happy mood out of it.', '2004-02-17 22:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(583987, 58935, 327, '<td valign="top">Then please don''t let go!! :)</td>', 'Then please don''t let go!! :)', '2004-02-17 22:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
