(583991, 59699, 327, '<td valign="top">Letting go...of food from a used fork? The off color dish water is not really appealing to me, but I will say you captured the bubbles well. Your light is okay too. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Letting go...of food from a used fork? The off color dish water is not really appealing to me, but I will say you captured the bubbles well. Your light is okay too. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-17 22:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
