(583994, 59210, 327, '<td valign="top">This may be a typical area where you live, but to me it makes me think if jail. I guess from your title it''s not jail. lol The boys and his expression is good. I would of liked less bars and more of him. Also the light and shadows is very attractive here. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This may be a typical area where you live, but to me it makes me think if jail. I guess from your title it''s not jail. lol The boys and his expression is good. I would of liked less bars and more of him. Also the light and shadows is very attractive here. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-02-17 22:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(583995, 59644, 15428, '<td valign="top">well timed! nice shot!</td>', 'well timed! nice shot!', '2004-02-17 22:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(583997, 59628, 15330, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop would be better, but I understand how hard it is to capture a bird, especcially in a unique pose. I think you can improve the composition, the branch makes it interesting, but it could be better. Maybe moving the frame to the left so the bird is on the right half.</td>', 'A tighter crop would be better, but I understand how hard it is to capture a bird, especcially in a unique pose. I think you can improve the composition, the branch makes it interesting, but it could be better. Maybe moving the frame to the left so the bird is on the right half.', '2004-02-17 22:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
