(584487, 58841, 14398, '<td valign="top">time for my rant...just plainly this has got to be a joke, a 4.91? oh yeah, i know why, there was no cats, flowers, or rain drops domintaing. this must have been what the people who are offended were thinking they only like to see "happy" things. i''m not sorry but this is not in bad taste, it''s a depiction of an everyday occurence, but you turn a blind eye to it and live in your little suburban home with with your nice little $300k house. not everyone is like that. and to the nice bloak who chose to take the time and copy and paste the rules for me, i''m so grateful because i totally forgot that a photography site chastizes originality and creativity. mayve i should sellout and take little pictures of cats and flowers that lack no substance or meaning. "misses the point," oh please, did you even look at the photo? or are you the suburbanite that i am referring to? oh yeah, and if you were so deeply offended and could not longer continue to look at the photo because it depicted drug and alcohol use, why didn''t you request a DQ? yeah, because you''re all talk and no walk. don''t bitch unless you''re going to do something about it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-18 02:55:34.</i></td>', 'time for my rant...just plainly this has got to be a joke, a 4.91? oh yeah, i know why, there was no cats, flowers, or rain drops domintaing. this must have been what the people who are offended were thinking they only like to see "happy" things. i''m not sorry but this is not in bad taste, it''s a depiction of an everyday occurence, but you turn a blind eye to it and live in your little suburban home with with your nice little $300k house. not everyone is like that. and to the nice bloak who chose to take the time and copy and paste the rules for me, i''m so grateful because i totally forgot that a photography site chastizes originality and creativity. mayve i should sellout and take little pictures of cats and flowers that lack no substance or meaning. "misses the point," oh please, did you even look at the photo? or are you the suburbanite that i am referring to? oh yeah, and if you were so deeply offended and could not longer continue to look at the photo because it depicted drug and alcohol use, why didn''t you request a DQ? yeah, because you''re all talk and no walk. don''t bitch unless you''re going to do something about it.', '2004-02-18 02:21:27.000000', '2004-02-18 02:55:34.000000', 0),
