(584564, 59701, 8953, '<td valign="top">Once again I gave myself about one hour to get this shot from camera to the challenge:) no time to make comments or pick a gallery to place this in. My wife does a great job of putting up with me and allowing herself to become a model. There is water in the tub as well as bubbles but the low light hides that truth. The water level could have been higher. <br/> <br/>Thanks to all those that rated this so well....<br/> <br/>To those that felt this rated a 1 or a 2 I sure would like to know how I failed your sense of even a three? but alas you are the very, very, very few:) you work out to be about 1 percent of the voting public and with that  "Insignificant"<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-18 03:29:36.</i></td>', 'Once again I gave myself about one hour to get this shot from camera to the challenge:) no time to make comments or pick a gallery to place this in. My wife does a great job of putting up with me and allowing herself to become a model. There is water in the tub as well as bubbles but the low light hides that truth. The water level could have been higher.  Thanks to all those that rated this so well.... To those that felt this rated a 1 or a 2 I sure would like to know how I failed your sense of even a three? but alas you are the very, very, very few:) you work out to be about 1 percent of the voting public and with that  "Insignificant"', '2004-02-18 03:25:13.000000', '2004-02-18 03:29:36.000000', 0),
(584586, 59658, 8953, '<td valign="top">I had come through and moved this to a nine from an eight:) I think I helped you beat me:) this was outstanding and worthy of a ribbon! Good job. Super idea with the laptop. <br/> <br/>Congrats!<br/> <br/>Richard<br/> <br/>P.S.<br/> <br/>Hard to believe this was given so many threes...there is no pleasing some folks.</td>', 'I had come through and moved this to a nine from an eight:) I think I helped you beat me:) this was outstanding and worthy of a ribbon! Good job. Super idea with the laptop.  Congrats! Richard P.S. Hard to believe this was given so many threes...there is no pleasing some folks.', '2004-02-18 03:48:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(584624, 58671, 14603, '<td valign="top">Congrats on an excellent piece of work...I`m apologising for my remarks about the noise as I have realised it was an element of the overall picture...(just not experienced enough to appreciate these things yet).<br/> <br/>Well done.<br/> <br/>Gordon</td>', 'Congrats on an excellent piece of work...I`m apologising for my remarks about the noise as I have realised it was an element of the overall picture...(just not experienced enough to appreciate these things yet). Well done. Gordon', '2004-02-18 04:30:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(584686, 58796, 16075, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite photo in this challenge and I gave it a very high score.  I like it even better now that I know it is unedited from the camera.  I know it takes a lot of skill to do all of the enhancements, etc. in the photo editing programs and there are a lot of neat things you can do, but to get this great of a picture just by snapping the shot impresses me much more.  Keep up the great work...and I think you should have won the blue ribbon.</td>', 'This was my favorite photo in this challenge and I gave it a very high score.  I like it even better now that I know it is unedited from the camera.  I know it takes a lot of skill to do all of the enhancements, etc. in the photo editing programs and there are a lot of neat things you can do, but to get this great of a picture just by snapping the shot impresses me much more.  Keep up the great work...and I think you should have won the blue ribbon.', '2004-02-18 05:17:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(584702, 59701, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great job, Richard, I love the atmosphere of this photo and the DOF you used here is excellent! :-) Well deserved ribbon again. :-)</td>', 'Great job, Richard, I love the atmosphere of this photo and the DOF you used here is excellent! :-) Well deserved ribbon again. :-)', '2004-02-18 05:23:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(584750, 58862, 4258, '<td valign="top">I personally like this picture and the technique - but trying to analyse why you got just a 5.2 average. Here is what I think it could be (not in any particular order)<br/> <br/>1) Technique used often enough<br/>2) Does not tie very strongly with the challenge<br/>3) A woman in sexy lingerie getting up from an executive chair does not really match</td>', 'I personally like this picture and the technique - but trying to analyse why you got just a 5.2 average. Here is what I think it could be (not in any particular order) 1) Technique used often enough2) Does not tie very strongly with the challenge3) A woman in sexy lingerie getting up from an executive chair does not really match', '2004-02-18 06:10:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(584819, 59701, 11897, '<td valign="top">A well deserved ribbon.I agree the 1s and 2s etc. obviously have no concept of a great shot and a well thought out challenge entry.<br/>Paul.</td>', 'A well deserved ribbon.I agree the 1s and 2s etc. obviously have no concept of a great shot and a well thought out challenge entry.Paul.', '2004-02-18 07:03:18.000000', NULL, 0),
