(584846, 59304, 14453, '<td valign="top">That was favorite of the challenge. I think it deserved a much better score!  Technically it could be a bit more sharp, it miss definition a bit. But the composition and the emotions are really pleasing to me. Congratulation.</td>', 'That was favorite of the challenge. I think it deserved a much better score!  Technically it could be a bit more sharp, it miss definition a bit. But the composition and the emotions are really pleasing to me. Congratulation.', '2004-02-18 07:13:46.000000', NULL, 0),
