(584888, 59701, 13759, '<td valign="top">I like very much of your emotive point of view in your photography. When I saw  this in the challenge I really think that is your. Congratulations for this new ribbon to your collection. I hope you continue to bring up to us your graceful pictures.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-18 07:42:14.</i></td>', 'I like very much of your emotive point of view in your photography. When I saw  this in the challenge I really think that is your. Congratulations for this new ribbon to your collection. I hope you continue to bring up to us your graceful pictures.', '2004-02-18 07:41:22.000000', '2004-02-18 07:42:14.000000', 0),
(584895, 58911, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wo Z.  Pretty powoerfull image.  Thought this one would do better.</td>', 'Wo Z.  Pretty powoerfull image.  Thought this one would do better.', '2004-02-18 07:47:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(584926, 59701, 8159, '<td valign="top">Congrats on another ribbon Richard! I think you and your wife make a great team, considering all four of your ribbon-winning entries have had her as a large part of the composition! I like your composition here (except I might have tried a few shots with the candle behind her head in a different location) -- I tried doing a bathtub shot for the "At Rest" challenge and sort of fell flat. Considering how many DPC voters dislike the shallow DOF thing, you did really well, and, IMHO, it works in this shot.</td>', 'Congrats on another ribbon Richard! I think you and your wife make a great team, considering all four of your ribbon-winning entries have had her as a large part of the composition! I like your composition here (except I might have tried a few shots with the candle behind her head in a different location) -- I tried doing a bathtub shot for the "At Rest" challenge and sort of fell flat. Considering how many DPC voters dislike the shallow DOF thing, you did really well, and, IMHO, it works in this shot.', '2004-02-18 08:04:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(584967, 59701, 806, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image! Great shot; appealing to so many and for so many purposes!<br/></td>', 'Fantastic image! Great shot; appealing to so many and for so many purposes!', '2004-02-18 08:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
