(587377, 59701, 14156, '<td valign="top">I tried my best but I simply couldn''t find the water in the bathtub.</td>', 'I tried my best but I simply couldn''t find the water in the bathtub.', '2004-02-19 01:58:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(587414, 59062, 13440, '<td valign="top">Thanks again for those coming inputs... :D</td>', 'Thanks again for those coming inputs... :D', '2004-02-19 03:04:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(588251, 58843, 15940, '<td valign="top">I''d like to thank everyone who took the time to comment on my photo.  The comments were overall very helpful, especially to me, as I have just begun getting into photography.  This was my first entry into ANY photo contest, and I feel very welcome here at DP Challenge.  Thanks to all.</td>', 'I''d like to thank everyone who took the time to comment on my photo.  The comments were overall very helpful, especially to me, as I have just begun getting into photography.  This was my first entry into ANY photo contest, and I feel very welcome here at DP Challenge.  Thanks to all.', '2004-02-19 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(588346, 58841, 14773, '<td valign="top">This photo didn''t miss the point of the challenge at all, don''t mind those comments Xburnerx.  If the photo scored low it''s not because most people didn''t get it, because we did.  And 4.9 isn''t a very low score..it''s middle ground and that''s where this pic falls - in the middle.  Could be a great photo, but lacks the edge and realism that would come with such a scene.  I think everyone who didn''t get your point must''ve posted, such a minority, don''t be offended.  However, I myself was mildly perturbed by Rasai''s comment...there''s a reason so many junkies litter our streets: drugs work.  Doesn''t make abuse right, but doesn''t change the fact either.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-19 13:01:49.</i></td>', 'This photo didn''t miss the point of the challenge at all, don''t mind those comments Xburnerx.  If the photo scored low it''s not because most people didn''t get it, because we did.  And 4.9 isn''t a very low score..it''s middle ground and that''s where this pic falls - in the middle.  Could be a great photo, but lacks the edge and realism that would come with such a scene.  I think everyone who didn''t get your point must''ve posted, such a minority, don''t be offended.  However, I myself was mildly perturbed by Rasai''s comment...there''s a reason so many junkies litter our streets: drugs work.  Doesn''t make abuse right, but doesn''t change the fact either.  ', '2004-02-19 12:59:16.000000', '2004-02-19 13:01:49.000000', 0),
(588352, 59471, 15690, '<td valign="top">Great Photo Lori.  Your cousin reminds me so much of the pretty gal in the Shallow DOF challenge pic entitled "Natural Beauty." Good luck to you in future entries.</td>', 'Great Photo Lori.  Your cousin reminds me so much of the pretty gal in the Shallow DOF challenge pic entitled "Natural Beauty." Good luck to you in future entries.', '2004-02-19 13:03:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(588370, 58841, 14398, '<td valign="top">Goldberry, i understand. i just get worked up quite easily when i was just trying to open their eyes. i failed slightly, so i''ll just accept it.</td>', 'Goldberry, i understand. i just get worked up quite easily when i was just trying to open their eyes. i failed slightly, so i''ll just accept it.', '2004-02-19 13:13:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(588540, 59561, 117, '<td valign="top">Letting go with colors I could have named it that but I want people to view my image more than I''m concerned about the prize. Thanks for voting everyone.</td>', 'Letting go with colors I could have named it that but I want people to view my image more than I''m concerned about the prize. Thanks for voting everyone.', '2004-02-19 14:47:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(589110, 58671, 14035, '<td valign="top">This is one of the (if not THE) best photographs I have seen on this site. Some day I am going to ask you for a print of this.</td>', 'This is one of the (if not THE) best photographs I have seen on this site. Some day I am going to ask you for a print of this.', '2004-02-19 19:52:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(589719, 59701, 17182, '<td valign="top">I am a new member and this is the first challenge I voted on; and this shot is a deserving winner! I am a lover of classic black and white and the use of DOF to arouse emotion. Your use is beautiful. Also intriguing are the use of the sillouette with the extreme contrast. Great Job!</td>', 'I am a new member and this is the first challenge I voted on; and this shot is a deserving winner! I am a lover of classic black and white and the use of DOF to arouse emotion. Your use is beautiful. Also intriguing are the use of the sillouette with the extreme contrast. Great Job!', '2004-02-20 02:05:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(589753, 59534, 17182, '<td valign="top">the subject and dark mood of this shot is very appealing, and your technical choices of b&amp;w and the angle accent it. I agree on the cropping of the left and the little boy does look like he''ll "shoot his eye out"!</td>', 'the subject and dark mood of this shot is very appealing, and your technical choices of b&w and the angle accent it. I agree on the cropping of the left and the little boy does look like he''ll "shoot his eye out"!', '2004-02-20 02:44:20.000000', NULL, 0),
