(596415, 59675, 12448, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>This is a very interesting image, so much too look at and really make you wonder just what you are through with.  The diet or the junk food, LOL!<br/> <br/>As for the shot, as I mentioned, very busy, so much to look at and to try to figure out exactly what you are going for.  Upon looking very closely I can see the garbage bag around the bottom on the bottom left but the marshmellows under the bottle and book just don''t seem to set right if you were shooting down into the bag.  There is nothing supporting them, you know?  Also the cropping seems just a bit off for some reason, maybe if the bottle top was completely in the shot?  Too many things cut off, nothing completed leaving a sense of wanting in the shot.  The colors are well done and the contrast is there also as well as the lighting.  Not a bad shot overall, just a few little things that seemed a bit off.  <br/> <br/>Good Luck In Future Challenges!<br/> <br/>Deannda<br/>DNeufer@stny.rr.com if you have any questions or want to discuss this further!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! This is a very interesting image, so much too look at and really make you wonder just what you are through with.  The diet or the junk food, LOL! As for the shot, as I mentioned, very busy, so much to look at and to try to figure out exactly what you are going for.  Upon looking very closely I can see the garbage bag around the bottom on the bottom left but the marshmellows under the bottle and book just don''t seem to set right if you were shooting down into the bag.  There is nothing supporting them, you know?  Also the cropping seems just a bit off for some reason, maybe if the bottle top was completely in the shot?  Too many things cut off, nothing completed leaving a sense of wanting in the shot.  The colors are well done and the contrast is there also as well as the lighting.  Not a bad shot overall, just a few little things that seemed a bit off.   Good Luck In Future Challenges! DeanndaDNeufer@stny.rr.com if you have any questions or want to discuss this further!', '2004-02-24 16:22:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(596686, 59639, 10644, '<td valign="top">very interesting composition.  the clarity is good.  i think you could of improved the shot with better lighting on the foot and get rid of the blown out area next to the foot..maybe use a diffuser.  the angle is definately nice.  hope this helps<br/> <br/>diana</td>', 'very interesting composition.  the clarity is good.  i think you could of improved the shot with better lighting on the foot and get rid of the blown out area next to the foot..maybe use a diffuser.  the angle is definately nice.  hope this helps diana', '2004-02-24 20:12:43.000000', NULL, 0),
