(596720, 59375, 14012, '<td valign="top">**Critique Club**<br/> <br/>Hi Judy -<br/> <br/>The composition and lighting on your subject is good. Interesting take on the challenge.<br/> <br/><b>Possible Improvements:</b> <br/>There seems to be a bit of noise, as the subject is not in sharp focus. It looks like your focus may have actually been on the window. I think it may have looked better with a shallower DOF with the window blurred more. The brightness of the window is just a little distracting.<br/> <br/>Good luck with your future entries.<br/> <br/>-Chris</td>', '**Critique Club** Hi Judy - The composition and lighting on your subject is good. Interesting take on the challenge. Possible Improvements: There seems to be a bit of noise, as the subject is not in sharp focus. It looks like your focus may have actually been on the window. I think it may have looked better with a shallower DOF with the window blurred more. The brightness of the window is just a little distracting. Good luck with your future entries. -Chris', '2004-02-24 21:06:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(596941, 59675, 12674, '<td valign="top">Deannda,<br/> <br/>Thanks for taking the time to critique my photo. Very helpful comments...and I suppose too it was a bit unclear as to my intent, which was:  I''m through with the "South Beach Diet" (a low carb diet). The letting go is in binging on the high-carb beer, Breyers ice cream, marshmallows, and Rold Gold pretzels.  I had hoped that the orange "Lose Belly Fat First" label on the book cover might show up better through neck of bottle.  The book title may not be obvious enough. I can see that it is a bit much.  Thanks!!  Steve</td>', 'Deannda, Thanks for taking the time to critique my photo. Very helpful comments...and I suppose too it was a bit unclear as to my intent, which was:  I''m through with the "South Beach Diet" (a low carb diet). The letting go is in binging on the high-carb beer, Breyers ice cream, marshmallows, and Rold Gold pretzels.  I had hoped that the orange "Lose Belly Fat First" label on the book cover might show up better through neck of bottle.  The book title may not be obvious enough. I can see that it is a bit much.  Thanks!!  Steve', '2004-02-24 23:24:12.000000', NULL, 0),
